    "Hide Selection" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隐藏选区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide the background behind a layer mask, keeping the foreground subjects. The pixels stay, so the background can be painted back at any time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过图层蒙版隐藏背景，保留前景主体。不会删除像素，之后可随时用画笔恢复背景。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide the gamut warning" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隐藏色域警告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "高"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High quality" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "高质量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlight Clipping Indicator" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "高光剪切指示器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlight Priority" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "高光优先"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlight Priority protects bright edges. Color Priority also reduces color. Paint Overlay covers the edges evenly." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“高光优先”保护明亮边缘，“颜色优先”还会减弱边缘颜色，“绘画叠加”则均匀覆盖边缘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlight Recovery" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "高光恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlights" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "高光"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Histogram" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "直方图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold Shift to add or Option to subtract for one outline" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "创建单个轮廓选区时，按住 Shift 添加或 Option 减去"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Horizontal" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "水平"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Horizontal Centers" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "水平中心"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Horizontal Spacing" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "水平间距"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Horizontal ruler" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "水平标尺"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How big the light is" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置光源大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright a light has to be to flare; near 100, only the biggest, brightest spots" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置出现光晕所需的亮度；接近 100 时，仅最大的高亮点产生光晕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright a light has to be to sparkle; near 100, only the biggest, brightest spots" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置出现星芒所需的亮度；接近 100 时，仅最大的高亮点产生星芒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright the beams are" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置光束亮度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright the lines are where the picture is black, so they show even over black" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置线条在黑色区域的亮度，使其在黑底上仍可见"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How brightly lights open into discs" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置光点扩散成散景光斑后的亮度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far a color may be from the picked ones and still be selected" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置颜色与已取样颜色的最大允许差异"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far apart the copies are" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置副本之间的距离"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far apart the screen's lines are" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置网屏线条的间距"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far each color channel (0–255) can differ from the clicked color and still be selected" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置每个颜色通道（0–255）与点击颜色的最大允许差异"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far from each edge the sharpening reaches, in pixels." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置每条边缘向外锐化的范围（像素）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far from the light the beams reach" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置光束从光源延伸的距离"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in brightness the adjustment reaches." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置调整所覆盖的亮度范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in hue the adjustment reaches." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置调整所覆盖的色相范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in saturation the adjustment reaches." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置调整所覆盖的饱和度范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far into the scene the haze begins: low reaches up to the camera, high leaves all but the farthest parts clear" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置薄雾开始出现的距离。低值让薄雾延伸至相机近处，高值只在最远处起雾"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far out of focus: the size of each disc" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置失焦程度，即散景光斑的大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the blur softens, in pixels" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置模糊扩散的距离（像素）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the brightness is smoothed before it displaces the lines, from sharp ridges to rounded hills" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置置换线条前对亮度的平滑程度，可从尖锐山脊过渡为平缓丘陵"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the colors spread apart, red one way and blue the other" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置颜色分离的距离，红色与蓝色向相反方向移动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the lens's coatings turn each streak blue along its length; none keeps the light's own color" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置镜头镀膜让光带沿长度方向变蓝的程度；零值保留光源本色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the light spreads" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置光的扩散距离"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the light wraps around the subject's edges" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置光线绕过主体边缘的距离"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the spikes reach" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置星芒延伸的长度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the streaks reach across the picture" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置光带在画面中的延伸距离"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How fine the detail it sharpens: small for crisp texture, larger for a punchier look" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置要锐化的细节尺度：小值突出细纹理，大值增强整体观感"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long each frame shows" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置每帧显示的时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many pixels to expand, contract or feather the selection by" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置扩展、收缩或羽化选区的像素数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many spikes each light has, as the lens's aperture blades make them" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置每个光点的星芒数量，模拟镜头光圈叶片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many times the picture echoes, each fainter" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置逐渐变淡的图像副本数量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much colored speckle is smoothed into the colors around it" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置将彩色斑点平滑融入周围颜色的程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much fine texture and edges are kept while the grain is smoothed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置平滑颗粒时保留细纹理和边缘的程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much grain is smoothed from the picture's brightness" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置减少亮度颗粒的程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much light scatters: a soft halo around bright areas, and gently lifted shadows" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置光的散射量，在亮部周围生成柔和光晕并略微提亮暗部"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of each pixel's error spreads to its neighbors. Less gives flatter areas" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置每个像素扩散给相邻像素的误差量。较低的值产生更平坦的区域"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the gap a bright line fills; dimmer parts draw it thinner" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置亮线占据间距的比例，较暗区域的线条更细"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the profile distortion correction is applied." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置应用镜头配置文件畸变校正的程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the profile vignetting correction is applied." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置应用镜头配置文件暗角校正的程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much the beams break up into separate shafts" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置光束分裂成独立光束的程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How strongly edges and fine detail are brought out" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置增强边缘和细节的程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the light ends on the inside: low feathers it off softly from the edge, high holds it bright and ends it crisply" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置光线向主体内侧的收尾效果：低值柔和渐隐，高值保留亮度并形成清晰边界"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the line's ends, and each of its dashes and dots, are finished" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置线条及其每段虚线和点的端点样式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How thick the air is: haze lit by the light, thinner in front of the subject" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置空气中的雾浓度；光线照亮薄雾，主体前方的雾较淡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How this line's ends are finished" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置此线条的端点样式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "色相"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue Range" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
